        {"zh": "蜡脚在地面留下浅印", "en": "Waxen feet press shallow prints into the floor."},
        {"zh": "走两步就停下来稳一稳", "en": "Two steps, then a pause to steady itself."},
        {"zh": "火苗被自己的脚步带歪", "en": "Its own steps bend the little flame sideways."}
      ]
    },
